cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "hiresclip: high-resolution clipboard figures from PDFs for Office on macOS"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-04
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/biterik/hiresclip"
abstract: >-
  hiresclip replaces the PDF snippet copied from Preview or Acrobat on the
  macOS clipboard with a high-dpi PNG so that PowerPoint, Word and Excel paste
  a sharp, Windows-safe bitmap instead of the low-resolution TIFF.
  Funded by the Deutsche Forschungsgemeinschaft (DFG, German Research
  Foundation) under the National Research Data Infrastructure – NFDI 38/1 –
  project number 460247524 (NFDI-MatWerk consortium).
