    affiliation: >-
      Department of Materials Science, WW8-Materials Simulation,
      Friedrich-Alexander-Universität Erlangen-Nürnberg,
      Dr.-Mack-Straße 77, 90762 Fürth, Germany
keywords:
  - macOS
  - clipboard
  - PDF
  - PowerPoint
  - figures
  - PNG
